    text: 'Saya sama sekali tidak percaya pada orang yang tak punya satu pun kebiasaan buruk kecil yang bisa dimaafkan.',
    author: 'Mark Twain',
    category: 'kehidupan',
    source: 'https://en.wikiquote.org/wiki/Mark_Twain',
    original: 'I haven\'t a particle of confidence in a man who has no redeeming petty vices whatsoever.',
    citation: '"Answers to Correspondents", The Californian, 17 June 1865. Anthologized in The Celebrated Jumping Frog of Calaveras County, and Other Sketches (1867)',
